      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been getting those really painful kidney stones lately (calcium oxalate ones) and i'm trying to do a big detox to clean my system out. i was thinking about taking like 2500mg of vitamin c every day to help boost my immunity and just flush everything out... do u think that would help my kidney health or is it too much?",
