      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying but i'm really trying to avoid doctors right now because it's just so expensive and they always just tell you to drink more water which is annoying. if i don't want to go the 2500mg route, what's a high dose that's actually effective for detoxing without being \"dangerous\"? like, is there a specific amount i can take every morning that's safe enough that i don't need to worry about more stones, but high enough to actually work? just give me a number so i can start.",
